{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2020-12-21 16:34:00', 'title': 'WALGREENS MAKES IT EASY TO SAY GOODBYE TO THE LAST MINUTE HOLIDAY STRESS WITH CONVENIENT HOURS AND SERVICES', 'text': "DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS WE ENTER THE FINAL SPRINT OF WHAT HAS BEEN AN EXTRAORDINARY HOLIDAY SEASON, WALGREENS MAKES CHECKING OFF THAT HOLIDAY LIST TWICE AS EASY SO CONSUMERS HAVE MORE TIME TO CELEBRATE THE JOYS OF THE SEASON. WHETHER IT'S A MISSING INGREDIENT FOR THE FAMILY'S SECRET HOLIDAY RECIPE, BATTERIES FOR A REMOTE CONTROL TOY, MEDICINE FOR A SEASONAL COLD, A GIFT FOR VIRTUAL SECRET SANTA, OR A REPLACEMENT STRING OF HOLIDAY LIGHTS, WALGREENS HAS CONSUMERS' UNIQUE NEEDS COVERE"}